OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed woman after row
OL,4,Aover watch is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who killed a woman over claims
OL,7,Fhis watch had been stolen has been
OL,8,Fjailed for six years.
OL,10,FTony Grimes, 43, had been involved in
OL,11,Fan altercation with Patricia Irvine
OL,12,Foutside her home in Parkhead, Glasgow,
OL,13,Fon 12 May 2024.
OL,15,FJurors heard Grimes had blamed Irvine's
OL,16,Fson Jordan Wilson, 25, for the
OL,17,Ftimepiece going missing.
