OL,5,
OL,6,FHe struck Irvine, 53, on the body and
OL,7,Fcaused her to fall to the ground. She
OL,8,Fsuffered a fatal aneurysm following the
OL,9,Fincident and died in hospital two days
OL,10,Flater.
